            "send_to": "Alex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command_name": "RoleZero.reply_to_human",
        "args": {
            "content": "I've assigned Alex, our Engineer, to develop your impressive portfolio website called Trilogoweb using Vue 2. I've provided him with all your requirements, including the trust-building design, showcase of real results with case studies, emphasis on COD focus, Telegram order integration feature, and conversion-driven call-to-actions. The website will reflect the simplicity, speed, and clarity you're looking for, optimized for performance and focused on results. Alex will work on developing this portfolio website that will impress your potential clients right away."
